Refer to AGENTS.md for the full project context, tech stack, and coding standards.

Additional Cursor-specific rules:
- Database access goes through the Supabase server client (`@/lib/supabase/server`). There is no Drizzle schema in this repo.
- When changing the database, add a Supabase SQL migration and regenerate `apps/web/src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts`.
- Always verify builds pass after making changes: `pnpm --filter web build`
- Use TypeScript strict mode. Never use `any`.
- Prefer React Server Components. Only add "use client" when interactivity is needed.
